WEBVTT

00:55:29.164 --> 00:55:31.245
when they go through their own grief,

00:55:31.269 --> 00:55:35.452
to think broadly, as broadly
as they possibly can,

00:55:35.476 --> 00:55:38.887
as bravely and as radically
as they possibly can,

00:55:38.911 --> 00:55:40.616
about what their futures look like,

00:55:40.640 --> 00:55:43.337
because the truest and broadest reality

00:55:43.361 --> 00:55:46.471
is that there is a life that I
could only have with Rayya,

00:55:46.495 --> 00:55:48.139
and that life is gone,

00:55:48.163 --> 00:55:51.108
but there is also a life
that I can only have without her,

00:55:51.132 --> 00:55:53.091
and that life is just beginning.

00:55:53.115 --> 00:55:56.247
And the fact that I was so devoted to her

00:55:56.271 --> 00:56:00.406
was such an incredible
experience to have of love.